// publisher route to it — the guard is about the absence of a route, not the
// jurisdiction boundary itself. The runtime error deliberately does not
// advertise that as a remedy: entire-core gates the admin resume on
// jurisdiction alone (Server.mirrorResumeJurisdictionGate), so a foreign route
// here would not unblock the verb that surfaced the failure, and the boundary
// it crosses is the one repoadmin.Router keeps closed on purpose.
